            "notes": "In the old build, we built survival items like  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) and  [Siphon Gloves](item_099f8177-c2a4-4e13-b321-99349f8b1eb7) immediately, but I didn't notice a large difference in the ability to get mech back. Instead the new strategy is focus on ability power and lifesteal the first few rounds, so build [Ignition Burst](item_52bbc55a-2003-424a-99a0-a53e4941ec58) for later zoning and passive damage, and focus on ability power at the start to farm credits. If they're anti-dive, or projectile heavy, you can forgo this and instead get  [Facetanking](item_f8af63d1-1fd4-4758-86ce-96f1ef7ea1ea).\n\nTo do this, we'll take  [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295),  [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418), and  [Shady Spectacles](item_ef9bb72f-a56c-4fb6-a552-5abce0b943d7). Focus on flying above their team and zoning them out with lava, flying back to your frontline, and blasting them with missiles.",
