            "created_at": "2025-08-11T20:33:20.189342+00:00",
            "notes": "Pick up  [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) for some insane heals as both Baby and Mecha Dva, and to help with this we take  [MEKA Punch](item_70090fbf-a2ba-4b47-a3d9-1081546a3a47). One thing to know about  Gloomgauntlet is that it does not stack, it simply refreshes the timer on the heal and movement. It DOES increase melee damage, and the reset on boosters allows you to keep dropping lava with [Ignition Burst](item_52bbc55a-2003-424a-99a0-a53e4941ec58).\n\nYou still need to be careful with being close range unless you have the cash to pick up  [Nano Cola\u2122 Nitrous](item_9e63ff90-c7d7-4695-a6cb-575b2619a963), but currently, it takes 6-8 melee hits to re-mech if you don't shoot. If you can't get Nano Cola yet, pick up  [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) for some damage reduction, and  [Siphon Gloves](item_099f8177-c2a4-4e13-b321-99349f8b1eb7) can help live longer as baby.\n\nAt this point, save your ult for guaranteed re-mech, not as an offensive option for the rest of the game.",
