            "notes": "Round 4 and you're truly online. With 1 melee a second as baby Dva, you heal for 34 / second, have 50% damage reduction from nano, armor, a tiny hitbox, and are almost guaranteed a remech. But we can go further.\n\nPick up either  [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d) or  [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8). Both have their pros and cons, with Reduction field helping against damage over time and small instances of damage, while Nebula Conduit helping with big burst damage by letting you heal through it. Grab any of the optional items to help if you have enough cash.\n\nNow the goal is to constantly boost into their backline, dropping lava and smacking the enemy squishies. FORCE them to look at you. Live forever. DM characters like DPS hitscan, ana, moira if she's running orb build. Remech is all but guaranteed at this point, but watch out for counters like Rein pin, Orisa javelin, and sleep. You're also not completely immortal, you need to punch things with your little fists to live long enough to remech. Orisa and Zarya counter this the most with javelin spin and bubble.",
