        {
            "id": "0de0261c-cdd9-410d-8f5a-f553c052af37",
            "build_id": "e522c0de-bbd7-46b7-b857-cb6a584d6fc4",
            "round_number": 5,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-11T20:33:20.189342+00:00",
            "notes": "We pick up  [Facetanking](item_f8af63d1-1fd4-4758-86ce-96f1ef7ea1ea) to have a lot more sustainability. The DPS are doing insane damage at this point, leading to insane healing in your mech. If you picked it up in round one instead of  [Ignition Burst](item_52bbc55a-2003-424a-99a0-a53e4941ec58), then you can go for that or for something like  [Ultrawide Matrix](item_403fe162-4a59-4a8e-8af9-5f83267228e8).\n\nLiving forever and self healing like this means you'll earn a LOT of credits in the last three rounds. This is good, because it means by the end of this one we'll have a lot of control over what exactly we want our build to do. If you picked up  [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d) , pick up  [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) and vice verse. Pick up any of the optional items if you can afford them, but if you can get a second epic, go to round 6.",
