            "created_at": "2025-08-11T20:33:20.189342+00:00",
            "notes": "Here's where you have a choice, there's a lot of good options and I'll talk about all of them. Pick whichever one takes your fancy. I'll list my default option first, and then go from worst to best alternatives.\n\n[Rustung Von Wilhelm](item_aea17a63-3f55-4f91-8f49-a7793fbc56c4) is great for adding more armor to Baby and making Mech a lot harder to kill, a very safe option. It's usually my default.\n\n [Geneticist's Vial](item_c7443757-9e2a-4be8-b3a3-469ab64b0e9d) if you're confident in your team and want to self-rez. It's not the BEST option, but it's really funny!\n\n [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) if you're living long enough with bomb, and want some extra damage. \n\n [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c) if they're especially high in burst damage, such as Junkrat, Soldier rockets, or Freja explosive bolts.\n\n [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) is great for some passive healing in Mech, especially if they have more trickle damage such as beams. You have a truly ridiculous amount of health, but it doesn't heal as much in baby compared to Gloomgauntlet + Siphon Gloves.\n\n [Singijeon\u2019s Pulse Plating](item_033e4839-b8cb-49bf-ac8c-172bfce6d06f) I haven't experimented much with this, but if the enemy is projectile heavy, it goes extremely well with  [Facetanking](item_f8af63d1-1fd4-4758-86ce-96f1ef7ea1ea) and can get  you the guaranteed remech.",
